 "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RJ4CTmh_lnsQ7kNvwHhQPjS&_nc_oc=AdoKFJr16cZFr314dOjHKT4Mcc1IS1tr4RxwCvZcUw-JTdz8QURNaEmn_TH9r_Ni_fg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGdz7maYEysEHOWE5Dx49rV1y4JfOljAxlIs-R-TUuhSA&oe=6A8D77A6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VemnkiexRZAQ7kNvwFdeC11&_nc_oc=Adr6kL5Af-o7lptSdSjwvvXCya4knVvZc_JcVzGnR9eTeFrxrgTxiebHuksaeeTySh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLvNiDHSsPoAN0KjHYyOJNbRX9v1lliU9zaGj7J0vy_w&oe=6A8D6CF2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i6c1p9Er8ngQ7kNvwHEklIZ&_nc_oc=AdruNIxkHwKgVdpFt_Q959MOPOpI9R1UTw8HdVwUkecgPvXSoD3e4a-4kBy4aMQsSBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFN3Izb5eB7tR5pgkTnZ2Fzp2U38WsG1In98xdo9PHFHg&oe=6A8D66BB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uwL6aJejfqwQ7kNvwHaQeu_&_nc_oc=Adq1-bwUv44Nauh5Z8eS2REaFO8QRNjncx6zTWuJ8CsrlfULYGyQ7e16o8H7yfBG24E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHgehQ15dcItE-yW7UZ1e4q7OjSQZ_yo80zKCtq6ViMLg&oe=6A8D7C33"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0p5VBr5kc_YQ7kNvwGkfMPV&_nc_oc=Adq_v7Tkt_eh4jzbLmiyyhjULUzlo055vpE-yEP11Zyx0qLKoM97gcNcCGENQkBnbdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHuYupPkbcly71QZMlGl7l9fMZ4G2zZStkhI-OuI2JVng&oe=6A8D7A32"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OjPON14CnA8Q7kNvwH6X58j&_nc_oc=AdqNwM_9SDhg8wQDAbTvGZL_DgXryWgNA5cfsGl5vDQ5fBNwOgu7EuJoynpY0JWrpsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGygac2AlX2SbReZL_lJtBlGVpLjS_0Q3iIkEMHQn6caw&oe=6A8D7193"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MA5jcB9wNqcQ7kNvwEuukJb&_nc_oc=AdqsogcgdFPdZS62oy_BB361s_qV68_fyE6ROVvd-Sa5Aune63ogjN6jqpr9vdU4Vik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETdBHE5Z9A1EzEVnbuSFPZjxlNUjp6h8BBUnOAZ_rAvw&oe=6A8D6DAF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ouzgnxWan1kQ7kNvwFVtpr-&_nc_oc=AdrUmjhALOePU_cZu0DdMSZ5_4_Vs2G9lop8zgGHmE7w2KvEzhcuNANQWwK1FCQPNDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE2xxgJZ3a-hNZYZW_UmF2IswYiD2PQkUMOapznvc-mXQ&oe=6A8D7962"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_97